     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRAuthorLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRAuthorLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRAuthorLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\">Logical model - FR LM Header Document</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-author.html\">CDA - author</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMHeaderDocument.author</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-author.html#s-Author\">Author</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMHeaderDocument.author:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-author.html#s-Author.assignedAuthor\">Author.assignedAuthor</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>L'auteur professionnel de santé est de type FRLMHealthProfessional, cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMHeaderDocument.author:organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-author.html#s-Author.assignedAuthor\">Author.assignedAuthor</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>L'auteur structure est de type FRLMOrganisation, porté par assignedAuthor.representedOrganization, cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMHeaderDocument.author:device</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">Author.assignedAuthor.assignedAuthoringDevice</td><td>L'auteur système est de type FRLMDevice, cf. FRDeviceLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\">Logical model - FR LM Header Document</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-composition-document.html\">FR Composition Document</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMHeaderDocument.author</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-composition-document.html#s-Composition.author\">Composition.author</a></td><td>1..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Composition.author.resolve().ofType(PractitionerRole or Organization or Device)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMHeaderDocument.author:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">Composition.author.PractitionerRole</td><td>Composition.author.resolve().ofType(PractitionerRole) — cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMHeaderDocument.author:organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">Composition.author.Organization</td><td>Composition.author.resolve().ofType(Organization) — cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMHeaderDocument.author:device</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">Composition.author.Device</td><td>Composition.author.resolve().ofType(Device) — cf. FRDeviceLMCDAFHIR (composant commun).</td></tr></table></div>"
